<h1 id="summary">Summary</h1>

<p>With Masonry, we can more conveniently and quickly achieve the desired layout effects without writing macros to distinguish between notch screens and other screens, because what we’re actually manipulating is the range within the safe area. In your free time, pay more attention to open-source code and write demos to experiment.</p>

